[{"title":"次临封八景韵 其二 灵洲渔唱","author":"蒙尧佐","text":"障住西江葭菼洲，何年杀气溢矶头。\n剩传霸主横天势，宁及渔家清唱秋。\n不闻尘世朝昏改，惟见绿波日夜流。\n生涯莫厌微如许，柔橹烟霞浪漫游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次临封八景韵 其三 蟠龙烟雨","author":"蒙尧佐","text":"闻说蟠龙形胜森，独多烟雨入春深。\n朝迷树杪山牵练，风过堤头柳拂金。\n入望空濛阑客思，悬知霢霂慰农心。\n苍天若为遐方恤，甘澍年年遍绿阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次临封八景韵 其四 濯锦醇酤","author":"蒙尧佐","text":"三冬酒熟庆年丰，濯锦山前处处同。\n席上几看人自醉，座中一点笑颜红。\n青回竹叶凝朝露，香入梨花趁晚风。\n仙令当年颜已驻，丹砂谁解在瓶中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次临封八景韵 其五 西山晴雪","author":"蒙尧佐","text":"五岭地炎蚤解冰，西山积雪看消零。\n几多柳眼悬珠泪，无数花纹点画屏。\n瓦屋渐镕檐溜白，琼瑶才散山容青。\n杜门正学袁生卧，泛艇谁来访草亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次临封八景韵 其六 南寺钟声","author":"蒙尧佐","text":"梵林地僻绝嚣纷，隐隐钟声隔岸闻。\n扣急池边惊野鸟，响馀门外驻飞云。\n山僧出定鲸鲵吼，行客思家车马勤。\n遥想碧纱千载事，为谁依旧勒名勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次临封八景韵 其七 景星夜月","author":"蒙尧佐","text":"星名古寺遗踪远，月挂空山分外明。\n竹影却疑蟠影动，松声时带磬声清。\n光分郊野昏如画，照彻浅崖险亦平。\n谁使传灯来此处，清辉今已彻专城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次临封八景韵 其八 猿岭飞泉","author":"蒙尧佐","text":"峻岭迢递势倚天，山猿穴处泻飞泉。\n倾来银汉千溪润，散作琼花满地圆。\n孙楚怡情食入耳，伯淳垂老乐前川。\n临流漫说尘缘净，清濯缨丝自豁然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄鹄篇","author":"陈子壮","text":"黄鹄浴其羽，矫绝淩青苍。\n黄鹄志四海，飞飞归故乡。\n故乡得相见，四海徒相望。\n燕识主人心，胡为恋屋梁。\n精卫思填海，空水日已扬。\n金石有变迁，沧桑岂足量。\n不见蜉蝣子，楚楚明衣裳。\n恶木非我阴，覆车非我粮。\n闵彼事区区，引缴欲奚伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初归饮顺虎家兄东皋别业 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"美兄池馆敞东郊，话我桑麻出野庖。\n山水经营始宁墅，画图二十孟城坳。\n鸣琴况惬邱中赏，语燕真移海上巢。\n大好归来同艺藿，差怜栖息学诛茅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初归饮顺虎家兄东皋别业 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"桃李春风忽满园，高楼更见棣华繁。\n赓诗晚就啼莺坞，习射晴临走马原。\n满目云山多汉垒，百年天地有青门。\n看君日发蛇龙蛰，蚯蚓惟知一壑尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东皋九龙井","author":"陈子壮","text":"九龙胡去来，一雨洗灵穴。\n其上莲花界，玲珑印潮月。\n咒钵理则然，卓锡神应设。\n圣液泌清凉，元珠时出没。\n趺石證水经，癯饮畅禅悦。\n果行惟蒙泉，受福须井渫。\n各以聪明因，兹为上善说。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酌徐木之濠想亭","author":"陈子壮","text":"折简应时邻即催，角巾随意客能来。\n宅边深贮一池月，物外重温永夜杯。\n常恐佳期妨杜若，休怜生计任蒿莱。\n从容却笑濠梁侣，东海投竿日几回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄逢永过访同赋","author":"陈子壮","text":"归田今日遂平子，学圃由来分小人。\n半亩花开不改色，三城客散几经春。\n怀湘却厌骚音盛，反鲁胡忧雅道沦。\n蒋径实寻羊仲旧，翟门虚拟雀罗新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东皋和欧嘉可","author":"陈子壮","text":"春园几度惜芳菲，几度美人春望微。\n此地舞雩初试袷，空山薜荔且同衣。\n劳将莺谷殷勤唤，故伴鸰原自在飞。\n行路十年今始信，声声啼鸟不如归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过黎介嘉树堂","author":"陈子壮","text":"谢家宾从几追欢，池馆重来改筑宽。\n坐有高楼临睥睨，不知遥岫入栏干。\n锦鳞翠羽依人在，时竹新花耐晚看。\n回首瑶琴虚自碎，底须寥落向君弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张二无督学数造敝庐余方屏迹虚其盛意赋诗谢之","author":"陈子壮","text":"药洲春水碧粼粼，栗里尤承绛幄亲。\n盛有诗书传鲁族，漫将鸡犬说秦人。\n冥鸿自顾惊弦后，凡鸟何当命驾频。\n自古西河有干木，肯容疏放学高真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禊日效兰亭体二首 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"春服既成，少长乃携。\n遨游天地，万物一齐。\n羲皇不逖，觞咏于斯。\n仁智高深，乐尔忘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禊日效兰亭体二首 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"芳渚错新藻，惠风睦清讴。\n汎兹波间羽，两两鯈鳞游。\n形神既相属，耳目固难留。\n悦理自一朝，安复滞织忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何凝生投诗戏用屠纬真体赠之","author":"陈子壮","text":"明月曾传碧海箫，所思终未报琼瑶。\n君家夹毂相逢易，公子西园结客遥。\n劳向秋风歌桂树，岂无春水送兰桡。\n景阳锦段江郎得，催使鲛人夜织绡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祈雨行 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"卉腓穗愞蒙荒陌，斥卤膏场尽龟坼。\n农家停耜日如年，郁轸隆蒸犹弗释。\n二仪旷废失春和，非时硉兀火旻多。\n难鞭螮暕胜氛祲，错教荟蔚作滂沱。\n盍将此意呼阊阖，璧牲虚荐竟如何。\n三城夜夜辉星月，南巷舞雩北里歌。\n吹笙伐鼓枌榆侧，可怜士女转婆娑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祈雨行 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"海滨父老卧田庐，三风十雨我生初。\n当春旱熯从来无，枉杀应龙南方居。\n请向灵坛焚尪巫，汤祷桑林禹阳旰。\n烦忧谁与广川书，居积贸迁非所图。\n夕飧元不计朝餔，百钱斗粟莫支吾，因而啸聚岂尽屠。\n不见去年艚籴一无倚，抢攘招呼不可止。\n巡按焦头太守匿，若辈无知亦弃市。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过黄子有作","author":"陈子壮","text":"庭花方灼灼，阶鸟复翩翩。\n本拟旱云赋，翻酬明月篇。\n一经宁尚白，对客况思玄。\n莫问齐名事，新诗与世传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中柬黄子","author":"陈子壮","text":"雩歌君懒和，佳雨亦徐来。\n太守亭边喜，杜陵诗里催。\n楼花润色点，江鸟乱空回。\n勇读知鎏麦，子耕沾足哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过酌公逊夜得霖雨喜而有作","author":"陈子壮","text":"近市一重扉，觞飞雨亦飞。\n清澜即濠上，骤瀑似山围。\n始觉滂沱应，虚疑稼穑非。\n苍天放行乐，携手莫教稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答欧子建","author":"陈子壮","text":"多年散木成劳薪，每羡文园卧病身。\n龙泉太阿知我者，历落钦崎可笑人。\n宗国亦忧漆室女，高天乃吊湘累臣。\n无端重下苍生涕，不愿君王问鬼神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与木之围棋嘉可诵弇州和长庆诗仆亦和此二章 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"棋枰不是人间世，杯酒宁论身后名。\n醉眼昏花君莫笑，临场算道益分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与木之围棋嘉可诵弇州和长庆诗仆亦和此二章 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"长庆诗人扫古体，弇州前辈聚时名。\n争向枯棋三百道，沿边趋罫作聪明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"若上人新辟禅讲偕黎黄传诸君往观酌智上人方丈","author":"陈子壮","text":"宰官说法真无意，静者寻僧若有期。\n白马近传支遁理，碧云曾拟惠休诗。\n泉深旧井疑龙伏，香溢空林觉鸟移。\n也为柴桑开酒禁，宗雷相对莫攒眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛日与诸君泛舟江上俗是日已陈龙舟之戏谓之出水龙","author":"陈子壮","text":"褰裳不及待芙蓉，共听潮音海寺钟。\n成佛吾甘灵运后，登仙谁蹑李膺踪。\n鸥波直信浮天鹢，鼍鼓俄能起壑龙。\n何事鉴湖私一曲，悦君随喜棹歌逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邀庄景说候船撰酌东皋同作","author":"陈子壮","text":"背郭新畴一径偏，数声黄鸟绿阴穿。\n不嫌初服牵宫锦，共操南音入野弦。\n菡萏月明山雨后，琅玕风细烛花前。\n欲知鸡黍田家约，即是星槎海上仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄景说奉使靖江王邸往来五羊见访赋此赠别 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"禁苑春光渺后尘，采风何地不咨询。\n千年铜柱开藩邸，一日金銮捧命臣。\n赋比淮南山八桂，占当星汉月重轮。\n飞旌五两频来往，父老相望越水滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄景说奉使靖江王邸往来五羊见访赋此赠别 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"物色青门自一丘，齐名不敢望龙头。\n金装本异陆郎节，绣被还同王子舟。\n日出珊瑚轮海市，风薰翡翠点江楼。\n山灵作意邀清盼，黄绢新词愧莫酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"景说舟中酬赠丁山人","author":"陈子壮","text":"闽粤山川未阻修，重来已是十年流。\n鱼梁独许庄生乐，槎影真随汉使浮。\n丹检玉函时引目，灵岩石室几寻幽。\n鹪鹩已自忘机侣，不信难留海上鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30890,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"区启图兄弟邀同谢起东黄元卿酌云筏","author":"陈子壮","text":"得归白社倦扶筇，开径难辞野鹿踪。\n谢客风期深揽结，郗家文酒盛过从。\n池光隐映双趺塔，花气依微片石峰。\n副墨新藏知在此，窗松砌竹已成龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30891,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孙青宕归宁波 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"乡心一夜渺难挥，明月刀头兴欲飞。\n北阙犹须长策入，南天不是倦游归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30892,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孙青宕归宁波 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"结伴越江江可怜，荔枝齐掷孝廉船。\n侬家不省将离曲，尚欲留欢歌采莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30893,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孙青宕归宁波 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"嘈嘈丝管趁游程，不及兴公掷地声。\n可但熟骚作名士，澧兰沅芷一江情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30894,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孙青宕归宁波 其四","author":"陈子壮","text":"绛帐谁能学鲤趋，康成又见领门徒。\n不知礼乐东归后，文采还教作凤雏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30895,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孙青宕归宁波 其五","author":"陈子壮","text":"最爱风流贺季真，酒中遂识谪仙人。\n当年乞得归来地，十亩湖光尽不贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30896,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为黎瑞生题其先世画龙","author":"陈子壮","text":"蜿蜓霖雾里，鳞甲转分明。\n柱下真人气，云间小陆名。\n书堂吟片玉，剑匣□双精。\n自是荀家物，谁能为点睛。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30897,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文止弟出市买磬诗以雅之 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"选石不能声，玲珑对窗牖。\n欲清俗客谈，还觅泗滨友。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30898,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文止弟出市买磬诗以雅之 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"弟也习音乐，一室自鸣球。\n五月候夷则，黄钟律应不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30899,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起见逢永题壁而去追和一首","author":"陈子壮","text":"三间红日足，半亩绿阴閒。\n不是卧龙处，空劳题凤还。\n云山诗里态，岁月酒中颜。\n仍枕矶边石，飞花昼掩关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30900,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜过嘉可和何公子","author":"陈子壮","text":"五陵袭马气，夜夜拥佳人。\n白社吟诗过，青云结客真。\n还添今雨梦，遥忆旧花茵。\n胜事仙湖得，劳君为买邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30901,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何凝生过访索赠","author":"陈子壮","text":"闭户先生懒病真，翩翩弱冠报伊人。\n不妨清磬山公后，况有诗才水部新。\n左辔夷门常自下，小儿德祖更谁伦。\n卜居亦就柴桑里，每爱琴尊狎隐沦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30902,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿冯大姑诗","author":"陈子壮","text":"王母过八十，而姑六十强。\n共以迎春酒，兹为献寿觞。\n姑来寿王母，綵服诸父行。\n入门各自媚，有如三凤凰。\n挟有八九雏，于姑亦称王。\n王母颔姑喜，岁月暗记量。\n若也初生辰，兹辰正相望。\n一粲受孙子，为姑合酬将。\n岁岁春风吹，为姑开北堂。\n北堂姑自开，承欢均未央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30903,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瀛洲丈人七十举子李伯襄宗伯黄逢永孝廉其婿也徵诗为寿","author":"陈子壮","text":"丈人行乐鉴江边，真境瀛洲遂盛传。\n闻道麒麟天上瑞，不知七十地行仙。\n一星南极辉珠蚌，连璧东床引玉田。\n宁似世人婚嫁累，移家游岳定何年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30904,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和黄士明少宰四首 其一 咏尘","author":"陈子壮","text":"支离满天地，点点度轮蹄。\n堠火传边近，烟花障陌低。\n陆生衣本素，楚客志须泥。\n沧海飞扬甚，无嗟浩劫迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30905,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和黄士明少宰四首 其二 咏柳絮","author":"陈子壮","text":"望去千丝碧，飞来万玉明。\n高低非一态，蜂蝶不相惊。\n乍拟纷纷雪，宁为泛泛萍。\n隋堤三月莫，沾惹舞衣轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30906,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和黄士明少宰四首 其三 咏草","author":"陈子壮","text":"蒙茸多露处，生意几鲜新。\n希日不遗汝，春风偏趁人。\n王孙归兴切，游女踏歌频。\n揽结青袍色，留连芳树津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30907,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和黄士明少宰四首 其四 咏荇","author":"陈子壮","text":"芳池碧涧同，密藻细蒲通。\n深浅皆宜水，参差早入风。\n镜光容展叶，带弱不胜丛。\n下体如堪采，连钱冒汉宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30908,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短调歌 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"留欢始记侬，侬小识欢面。\n攀花有故条，幸及经时艳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30909,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短调歌 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"莲花莫懊侬，侬有真颜色。\n十五始学歌，十六为郎得。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30910,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惆怅词","author":"陈子壮","text":"秋河黯淡月光斜，蜡烛分明泪绛纱。\n深树无媒引鹦鹉，错抛红豆入他家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30911,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题绿珠祠梧州","author":"陈子壮","text":"逝水徒传金谷园，荒山谁识绿萝村。\n生辟故井难销艳，命薄高楼敢负恩。\n燕子频来多恋主，杜鹃啼断为招魂。\n恁君一和懊侬曲，自有人将孤笛翻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30912,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初秋同何龙友黎君选马伯起金相如雅集嘉显堂即席赋","author":"陈子壮","text":"共怜秋气迥，飒雨荐新凉。\n逸兴池边墨，清言竹下觞。\n栖乌明汉影，子鹤叶庭霜。\n韦杜寻堂会，琴尊遂一堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30913,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜即事戏赠何龙友","author":"陈子壮","text":"天上秋临玉镜台，小星三五映前台。\n明珠自古真无价，乌鹊今宵遂有媒。\n锦瑟弦中呈雅调，流黄机上试新裁。\n阮郎既识仙源路，桃叶桃根信往来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30914,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谢简之元戎归越","author":"陈子壮","text":"仗剑天南贯斗墟，坐销气霭见樵渔。\n交情不厌生刍淡，世路从知薏苡虚。\n嗜癖偶尘书记上，废吟重忆啸歌馀。\n苧萝山下东归客，试访鸱夷一舸如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30915,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谢生式臣元戎之子也谒予门下","author":"陈子壮","text":"美箭东南岂尽收，弃繻英妙更无俦。\n庭阶曾识将军树，湖海还惊谢眺楼。\n好向门生吹笛和，多惭父客执经游。\n长杨亦是誇胡技，鸣镝双雕看阿侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30916,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送龚培赤随谢简之越游","author":"陈子壮","text":"鱼鸟情亲自竹林，江湖不负远游心。\n军中阮瑀多优渥，门下袁郎独赏音。\n藿食定知弹铗易，布裘端及授衣深。\n分明一棹剡溪曲，画里名山尽意寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30917,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"智上人黎君选陶摇光欧嘉可载酒索书分赋得萍字","author":"陈子壮","text":"高僧处士宜相访，文雅淹留载酒亭。\n濡头著墨惟倚醉，青眼看君难独醒。\n自喜客添尊满满，不愁月薄烟冥冥。\n竹溪逸友足吾志，池上风多任打萍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"欧阳伯曦释逮初归偕诸子枉过有述","author":"陈子壮","text":"芰荷容易问初衣，鸟鹊何缘启夕扉。\n明月恰随公子盖，小园同偃丈人机。\n诗名拓落沧江稳，秋色峥嵘白露稀。\n盛世漫劳歌凤德，即今解网放鸿飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雷生行","author":"陈子壮","text":"雷生托迹皆仙术，丹山药鼎伴棋局。\n踪横不算世人机，检拾游囊解医国。\n扁舟海上飞来再，绝艺逢人谁不爱。\n癯形知有辟谷方，妙思只合橘中对。\n秋月春花满敝庐，消閒却病足清虚。\n淹留自是恣真赏，肯向王门学曳裾。\n鹡鸰风急雁声微，还山催发桂花期。\n木榻遥须暂相待，鞋鞋无恙更何之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答区启图閒居见存之作","author":"陈子壮","text":"将无萧瑟托閒居，剩有诙谐误禁庐。\n世事浑如千口酒，男儿何必五车书。\n清斋药臼新调鹤，散发荷衣旧钓鱼。\n不是美人相忆句，音尘容易到阶除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":30921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]